User Story- Local Music Library (see “A few notes about local music library” below)
Task- Design database setup to store files

Overview-
I have created database setup to store multiple files in local music library so that user can quickly access, play and manage music app.
This design helps user to identify quickly any song and artist.
The database design supports playlist functionality and allowing users to create and edit playlists effortlessly, making it easier to curate and enjoy custom lists of favorite songs.


